  "chain": "megawatt transducer circuit misconfigured LDA setpoint [cause B] + weather-induced grid fault -> turbine speed transient reaches 1810 RPM -> LDA function latches -> turbine control/intercept valves forced shut -> RCS pressure rises -> automatic reactor trip on high RCS pressure",
